OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Sunshine will turn a
OL,7,Flittle hazy at times through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mainly light winds, a
OL,9,Fmoderate northwesterly at first over
OL,10,FCaithness.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome evening sunshine then
OL,13,Fmost areas dry with some clear spells
OL,14,Ftonight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA mostly dry day though cloud
OL,17,Fmay be thick enough in the morning for
OL,18,Fthe odd spot of rain. Some bright
OL,19,Fspells and some hazy sunshine breaking
OL,20,Fthrough, slightly warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
